flowchart LR
    Runtime["Owned provider and read-tool loop"]
    Journal["Existing request and tool journal"]
    Artifacts["Immutable original-byte artifacts"]
    Capture["Capture append: typed version and session sequence"]
    SQL[("PostgreSQL: capture_events + capture_outbox")]
    Worker["Scoped leased delivery worker"]
    Graph[("FalkorDB: Source / Message / Observation / Attempt")]
    Receipt["Atomic Event + digest-bound receipt"]
    Projection[("SQL projection + contiguous offset: one transaction")]
    History["Authorized durable history SSE / pages"]
    Source["Authorized bounded Source range"]
    TUI["CLI / TUI: cursor reconnect, pending, available, missing, gap"]
    Runtime --> Journal
    Journal --> Artifacts
    Journal --> Capture
    Capture --> SQL
    SQL --> Worker
    Worker --> Graph
    Graph --- Receipt
    Receipt -->|"lost ACK: reconcile before replay"| Worker
    Graph --> Projection
    Projection --> History
    Artifacts --> Source
    Source -->|"source-only memory.retrieve"| Runtime
    History --> TUI
    Source --> TUI
